  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://biharvidhanparishad.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad</a></span> has released the Phase-II Revised Final Result for the post of Driver. This recruitment was issued for 24 posts. The Phase-II Exam was conduct on 25 May 2026. Online applying process for Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 29 September 2025 to 20 October 2025. Candidates who appeared for Phase-II examination can check their Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Revised Final Result 2026 which has given below.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Revised Final Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Advt No: 01/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>25 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; fon