>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 January 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>37 Years (General Male)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (General Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (BC/ EBC Male, Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>42 Years (SC/ ST Male, Female)</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #0000ff; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 24 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Driver</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">09</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Office Attendant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">15</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver, Office Attendant Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Driver :</strong> Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"173\">10th Class</strong>&nbsp;from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"260\">Hindi and English languages</strong>, possess a valid&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"305\" data-is-only-node=\"\">LMV/HMV Driving License</strong>, and also have the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"354\">ability to ride a bicycle</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Office Attendant :</strong> Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"146\">10th Class</strong>&nbsp;from a recognized board. They should have knowledge of&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"233\">Hindi and English languages</strong>&nbsp;and must have the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"281\" data-is-only-node=\"\">ability to ride a bicycle</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Bihar Vidhan Parishad Driver Phase-II Revised Final Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong> section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Download Phase-II Revised Final Result</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration no</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the Phase-II Revised Final Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the Phase-II Revised Final Result from the official website of also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #00000